  "question": {
    "text": "A charge $+q$ is placed at the origin $O$ of $X-Y$ axes as shown in the figure. The work done in taking a charge $Q$ from $A$ to $B$ along the straight line $A B$ is <img src=\"assets\\qt0046_90cd0e49c6e7.png\">"
